   "lines": [
    "This is the last Sunday",
    "I shall spend here be-",
    "-fore I am married;",
    "when next I come",
    "to Oyster Bay it",
    "will be with my",
    "darling bride. I do",
    "so hope and pray",
    "I can make her",
    "happy; I shall try",
    "very hard to be",
    "as unselfish and",
    "sunny tempered as",
    "she is. It almost",
    "frightens me, in spite",
    "of my ^our^ happiness, to",
    "think that perhaps I",
    "may not make her",
    "happy; but I shall try",
    "so hard; and if ever",
    "man loved woman",
    "I love her."
   ],
   "rows": null,
